:Namespace Evaluation
    ⍝ Evaluation of positions.

    ⎕IO ⎕ML←1

    evaluate←{
        ⍝ Material balance of a position.
        ⍝ ⍵ ←→ bitboards, game state
        ⍝ ← ←→ score in centipawns; positive when the side to move is ahead

        (bitboards game_state)←⍵

        ⍝ The weighted sum below is from white's point of view. Negating it
        ⍝ when black is to move gives the side to move's point of view,
        ⍝ which negamax search requires.
        sign←1-2×game_state[##.GameState.side]

        ⍝ Piece codes are bitboard row indices, so indexing by code puts
        ⍝ each weight on its piece's row. Black pieces count negatively.
        weights←12⍴0
        weights[##.Pieces.(P N B R Q K)]←100 320 330 500 900 0
        weights[##.Pieces.(p n b r q k)]←-weights[##.Pieces.(P N B R Q K)]
        score←+/weights×+/bitboards
        score×sign
    }
:EndNamespace